roboparty-imu (1.4.2-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * MCT7123 CAN FD: parse the complete dbc.txt frame set; Running_Status,
    Fusion_Status and the 0x183 config message are now stored instead of
    dropped.
  * Add Mct7123IMUDriver accessors: get_mag, get_euler, get_timestamp_ms,
    get_cycle, get_running_status, get_fusion_status, get_config.
  * Fix 0x182 status offsets (Fusion_Status 38 -> 40, Running_Status 42 ->
    44) per the DBC "Start Bit" column; systimer unit documented as ms.
  * Validate 0x183 config enum fields; out-of-range frames are rejected and
    the last known-good config kept.
  * Add UART-format output for CAN frames: mct7123_build_frame(),
    IMUSerialPort::send(), enable_uart_forward().

 -- RoboParty <cenliey@qq.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 14:11:03 +0800

roboparty-imu (1.4.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Align the hipnuc driver protocol decoders with the upstream SDK: unified
    samples for serial and CAN, remove the obsolete parser compatibility
    layer.
  * Add the HiPNUC CAN OTA tool (scripts/hipnuc_ota.py): version query and
    firmware update with model gating, SHA-256 reporting, HiPNUC image
    validation, JSON output, power-cycle recovery and a single-master bus
    check.
  * Add the IMU OTA entry point (scripts/imu_ota.py) dispatching to the
    HiPNUC (hipnuc_ota.py) and MCT7123/MD7123 (mct_ota.py) update modules.
  * Install the OTA Python modules to site-packages and the configured install
    prefix (default /opt/roboparty)/bin; add the python3-can runtime dependency.
  * Add the HIPNUC 1.7.2 firmware image, update DBC files and rename
    bundled firmware files.

 -- RoboParty <cenliey@qq.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 14:11:03 +0800

